comment6.text=\r\n\ reads\ data\ from\ a\ scanner\r\n\ first\ reads\ common\ data\ from\ the\ parent\ class,\ then\ reads\ Tool-specific\ data\r\n\ @param\ lineScanner\ Scanner\ object\ used\ to\ read\ input\ data\r\n
